        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection L015 Basket Weave Lever with R016 Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe intricate design of Baldwin's Basket Weave Leverset makes it an interesting, and beautiful point of interest for any door. There is something so elegant about the carefully crafted basket detailing that this lever and rose set would look great among even the most glamorous decors with out being gaudy or drawing too much attention to itself. It is available in a huge selection on finishes, each of which highlight all of its fantastic details. It will fit 1-3/8 inches and 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-L015-specifications.gif?v=1704354732\" width=\"333\" height=\"194\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin L015 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin L015 Basket Weave Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Basket Weave Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>R016 Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button located on rosette. An emergency release function allows the lever to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy function is handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Basket Weave Lever, Baldwin L015-R016",
                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection L015 Basket Weave Lever with R016 Rose - The intricate design of Baldwin's Basket Weave Leverset makes it an interesting, and beautiful point of interest for any door. There is something so elegant about the carefully crafted basket detailing that this lever and rose set would look great among even the most glamorous decors with out being gaudy or drawing too much attention to itself. It is available in a huge selection on finishes, each of which highlight all of its fantastic details. It will fit 1-3/8 inches and 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
